msgctxt "64"
msgid "Rikiya! Oh, thank god it's you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Something terrible's happened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "All right, all right. Calm down and tell me what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "It's Saki-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Huh? What about her!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I... I saw her in Hatsumachi with some woman I've never\r\n"
"seen before! Somethin' felt real off about the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "And you're sure it was her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Oh, well if it isn't the dashing young fella from before.\r\n"
"This must be fate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"C'mon, we don't got time for your hopeless flirtin'!\r\n"
"Let's try and focus!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Where did you see Saki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Coming outta the convenience store over at the intersection.\r\n"
"With some woman who was absolutely dressed to the nines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I wonder who she was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Maybe Saki's mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Then... you really think she went back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Hard to say. The only way to know for sure is to find\r\n"
"her and ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "...I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "By the way, Rikiya. You gonna have a party tonight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"A party? Aw, shit! It's the boss's birthday! I've been so\r\n"
"distracted, it totally slipped my mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"He's not gonna be in any mood for celebration if we can't\r\n"
"find Saki, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Then we're not doing ourselves any favors by standing\r\n"
"around. Come on, let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Right. We gotta bring her back, even if it's just for today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Let's move, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

